  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "エスパーエネルギーを　まぜこみながらつちと　すなで　どろだまを　つくる。どろだまは　いのちより　たいせつ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "에스퍼 에너지를 섞어서 흙과 모래로 진흙구슬을 만든다. 진흙구슬을 목숨보다 소중히 여긴다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會將超能力混進泥土和沙子裡製作出泥球。泥球比自己的命還重要。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il confectionne une boule de boue en mélangeant de la terre, du sable et de l’énergie de type Psy. À ses yeux, elle importe plus que sa propre vie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es vermischt Erde und Sand mit Psycho-Kräften, um eine Schlammkugel zu formen. Diese schätzt es mehr als sein eigenes Leben.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mezcla tierra, arena y energía psíquica para crear una bola de barro que atesora por encima de su propia vida.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mischiando energia Psico a terra e sabbia crea una palla di fango che considera più preziosa della sua stessa vita.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon creates a mud ball by mixing sand and dirt with psychic energy. It treasures its mud ball more than its own life.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "エスパーエネルギーを　混ぜこみながら土と　砂で　泥玉を　作る。泥玉は　命より　大切。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "将超能力混进泥土和沙子里制作泥球。泥球比自己的命还重要。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mezcla tierra, arena y energía psíquica para crear una bola de barro que atesora por encima de su propia vida.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "どろだまを　ころがしながらしんかの　エネルギーを　じゅくせいさせる。やがて　しんかのときを　むかえる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "진흙구슬을 굴리면서 진화를 위한 에너지를 숙성시킨다. 이윽고 진화의 때를 맞이하게 된다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會一邊滾著泥巴球，一邊使進化的能量成熟。最終會迎接進化的時刻。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il fait rouler sa boule de boue jusqu’à ce qu’il ait accumulé l’énergie nécessaire à son évolution.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Relluk wälzt seine Schlammkugel umher, während es die Energie für seine anstehende Entwicklung heranreifen lässt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Hace rodar la bola de barro para madurar energía hasta que alcanza el grado necesario para su evolución.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
